    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im taking haloperidol for my schizophrenia and i have a super bad sinus infection right now. my nose is totally blocked and i cant breathe right. is it okay if i take some sudafed to help clear it out? i just want to feel normal for a day",
